  {
    "id": "02_def_intro",
    "text": "在拥有了超级大脑和火眼金睛之后，AI 毕竟不是你肚子里的蛔虫，它需要一个指令来激活。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "ai_image",
      "prompt": "A glowing futuristic brain connected to a digital eye, surrounded by dark space, waiting for a spark of activation, cinematic lighting, 4k, detailed abstract tech style",
