  {
    "id": "12_prob_machine",
    "text": "大语言模型本质上是一个概率预测机。Prompt 的作用，就是框定这个概率的范围。",
    "visual": {
      "type": "manim",
      "prompt": "Visualize a wide bell curve representing probability. Then show a box narrowing the curve to a specific peak labeled 'Prompt Constraint'.",
